eos (coming soon banner for now)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tabbed interface","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for Description, Transcript, and Resources with smooth animations"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Compact technology pills","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" showing the technologies featured in each video"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Improved responsive design","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" that works beautifully on all screen sizes"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Enhanced typography and spacing","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for better readability"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Why This Matters:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"📚 Better learning experience","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" - Clean, distraction-free layout helps you focus on the content"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"💬 Community engagement","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" - New social features will help build discussions around videos"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"⚡ Faster navigation","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" - Tabbed interface makes it easy to switch between description, transcript, and resources"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"📱 Mobile-friendly","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" - Responsive design ensures great experience on any device"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":